<title>SINGAPORE: Times Publishing half year up 58.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Times Publishing half year up 58.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to February 28 1997</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    12.60	vs    7.93</p>
<p>    Dividend (cts)	 6.00	vs    6.00</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)   10.40	vs    6.50</p>
<p>    Turnover	     268.82	vs  245.90</p>
<p>    Investment income    2.13	vs    1.53</p>
<p>    Other income	   5.31	vs    4.12</p>
<p>    Interest expense     0.05	vs    0.78</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   7.55	vs    7.92</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	18.20	vs   13.29</p>
<p>    Associates income    0.54	vs    0.40 (loss)</p>
<p>    Tax			5.70	vs    4.66</p>
<p>    Minorities    (loss) 0.44	vs    0.29 (loss)</p>
<p>Dividend register - May 9 1997</p>
<p>Note - Full name Times Publishing Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
